prompts.skills:
You are an expert character builder for a d100 Weird Fiction RPG.

CHARACTER CONTEXT:
{context}

OCCUPATION: {occupation}
OCCUPATIONAL SKILLS: {occSkills}
{archetypeBlock}

NOTE: Recommended skills (archetype + occupation) have ALREADY been allocated deterministically: {recommended}. Do not touch them.
Your task: distribute the REMAINING pool across OTHER skills (flavorful, fitting the character background) to make the investigator well-rounded.

REMAINING POINTS TO DISTRIBUTE: {remaining}
PER-SKILL LIMIT: {limit}% (creation maximum)

SKILL LIST WITH BASE VALUES:
{skillsList}

CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:
1. Distribute EXACTLY {remaining} points - no more, no less!
2. Do NOT allocate to recommended skills (already done): {recommendedTop}
3. Pick skills fitting the character (background, description, traits)
4. Each skill may reach at most {limit}%
5. Spread points across fitting skills

Example: if Library has base 20% and you want 60%, you add 40 points.

Reply ONLY with plain JSON, no markdown:
{"skills": {"SkillName": newValue, ...}}

Include ONLY skills you add points to (new value > base).
THE SUM OF ADDED POINTS MUST BE EXACTLY {remaining}!

